1. I think you went in the wrong direction. Although the story is good and warm, what I actually wanted you to create was a promo film for Binance;
2. Your 2D animation assets are too poor, it might even feel better to use pixels instead;
3. The voiceover is also terrible.
Think carefully about how we should do this, I see on Twitter that what you made for other people looks really high-end.
